{"headword":"שֹׂ֫בַע","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>satiety, abundance</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:3\" href=\"/Exodus.16.3\">Ex 16:3</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂבַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:11\" href=\"/Psalms.16.11\">ψ 16:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.25\">Pr 13:25</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂבְעֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.25\">Dt 23:25</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂבְעָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:18\" href=\"/Ruth.2.18\">Ru 2:18</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>satiety</em>, as to food <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:18\" href=\"/Ruth.2.18\">Ru 2:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לָשׂ׳ (לֶחֶם) אָכַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:3\" href=\"/Exodus.16.3\">Ex 16:3</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.19\">Lv 25:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.5\">26:5</a> (both H), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:25\" href=\"/Psalms.78.25\">ψ 78:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָכַל</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּנַפְשְׁךָ שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.25\">Dt 23:25</a> <em>eat</em> grapes <em>according to thine appetite</em>, (namely) <em>thy fill</em>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָכַל לְשׂ׳ נַפְשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.25\">Pr 13:25</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>satisfying abundance</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳ שְׂמָחוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:11\" href=\"/Psalms.16.11\">ψ 16:11</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB09601","strong_numbers":["7648"],"next_hw":"שָׂבְעָה","prev_hw":"שָׂבֵעַ","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8427"],"TWOT":["2231a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","att